menu "BLE proxy"

config BLEPROXY_XIAO_RF_SWITCH
    bool "Drive the XIAO ESP32C6 RF switch (GPIO3 enable, GPIO14 select)"
    default y
    help
        The Seeed XIAO ESP32C6 routes the radio through an RF switch that
        picks the on-board ceramic antenna or the U.FL connector.

config BLEPROXY_EXTERNAL_ANTENNA
    bool "Use the external U.FL antenna"
    depends on BLEPROXY_XIAO_RF_SWITCH
    default y

config BLEPROXY_ACTIVE_SCAN
    bool "Active scanning (request scan responses)"
    default y
    help
        Some devices (SwitchBot among them) only send part of their data in
        scan responses.

config BLEPROXY_SCAN_INTERVAL_MS
    int "Scan interval (ms)"
    range 3 10240
    default 100

config BLEPROXY_SCAN_WINDOW_MS
    int "Scan window (ms)"
    range 3 10240
    default 100
    help
        Equal to the interval means scanning 100% of the time, which is fine
        since nothing else shares the radio.

endmenu
